    "rules": [
      "Pastel tags (stage, role, status) keep dark text in both modes.",
      "Filled primary and error buttons use onPrimary / dark error text in dark mode.",
      "Toast is inverted: dark on light mode, light on dark mode.",
      "Blur is allowed on cards, nav and sheets only; Android falls back to a solid surface at the same tint when blur is off.",
      "Pastel header tints (Won, Lost, Contacted) become dark tints in dark mode with light text.",
      "Toast action text uses the dark primary (#0B6E5E) on the light dark-mode toast.",
      "Disabled buttons use opacity .4 in both modes and are exempt from contrast checks.",
      "A frame that re-themes itself from a picked seed colour must define its dark variables explicitly."
